%% The reproduce-and-measure loop — five steps, each closing a credibility hole.
flowchart LR
    p[1 - Pick a recent no-code failure paper] --> s[2 - Reproduce a narrow slice on cheap models]
    s --> pre[3 - Pre-commit the statistics]
    pre --> j[4 - Judge-free deterministic oracle]
    j --> d[5 - State the honest delta - nulls as headlines]
    d -.->|next paper| p
